      "narrative": "Dome, Yosemite National Park, NPS. Transfer of command from CIMT (CA Team 3) to CIMT (CA Team 4) will occur tomorrow. One mile north of Wawona, CA. Timber, brush and heavy slash. Moderate fire behavior with flanking, uphill runs and single tree torching. Area, road and trail closures in effect. Timber, Los Padres NF, USFS. Four miles southeast of Big Sur, CA. Grass, timber and chaparral. Minimal fire behavior with creeping and smoldering. Numerous structures threatened. Area, road and trail closures in effect."
