      "narrative": "* San Francisco 2, Lower Rio Grande Valley NWR, FWS. Two miles south of LA Casita, TX. Grass and brush. Active fire behavior. Structures threatened. * Bradley Road, Alabama Forestry Commission. Fourteen miles west of Brewton, AL. Brush. Minimal fire behavior. Honey, Okmulgee Agency, BIA. Nine miles southwest of Okmulgee, OK. Grass and timber. Active fire behavior. Last report unless significant activity occurs. Stone Bridge, Oklahoma DOF. Five miles northeast of Wilburton, OK. Hardwood litter and brush. No new information. Last narrative report unless new information is received."
